# This repository is PUBLIC. It exists for one reason: to host the privacy
# policy and support pages that App Store Connect requires at a stable URL.
#
# The app source is deliberately NOT published. Everything is ignored except
# docs/ and .github/, so a stray `git add .` cannot put an unreleased codebase
# on the internet. That has to be a decision, not an accident.
#
# Note that the app's own README.md is a developer document and is ignored on
# purpose; the public repository landing page is .github/README.md.
#
# To open-source the app later: delete this file deliberately, review what is
# about to be committed with `git status`, and push.

/*

!.gitignore
!docs/
!.github/
